**Project:** GRAMOS MART
**Project Code:** GRM-IMP-001
**Version:** 1.0
**Project Owner:** Dakshakriti Product and Service
**Business Brand:** GRAMOS
**Master Product Brand:** GRAMOSFUEL
**Project Location:** Kota, Rajasthan, India
